In article <3kf1q2$681@nyx10.cs.du.edu> mtindall@nyx10.cs.du.edu (mtindall) writes:


>In article <3kdurt$gga@crl10.crl.com>, Bruce Umbaugh <bumbaugh@crl.com> wrote:

>>3. Although students may be compensated, that doesn't change anything (I 
